TABLE EXPLANATIONS

USERS stores HerdSync user accounts, roles, login credentials, notification settings, and profile information.
SESSIONS stores active login sessions using securely hashed session tokens.
CATTLE_BREEDS stores editable cattle breed choices used by livestock records.
LIVESTOCK stores the main cattle registry, including identity, sex, breed, birth date, weight, status, markings, and archive information.
LIVESTOCK_PHOTOS stores image URLs and display order for livestock photos.
LIVESTOCK_PARENTAGE stores sire, dam, and parentage certainty for livestock.
CONTACTS stores people and organizations with names, phone numbers, emails, and addresses.
PRACTITIONERS stores veterinary or animal-health personnel and links them to contact details and optional user accounts.
ACQUISITIONS stores how livestock entered the farm, including purchase, donation, transfer, or birth on farm.
QUARANTINE_RECORDS stores livestock quarantine periods, reasons, dates, status, and clearance information.
WEIGHT_RECORDS stores historical livestock weight measurements and recording information.
PHYSICAL_ASSESSMENTS stores physical examinations, body-condition scores, health status, and assessment notes.
HEALTH_RECORDS stores livestock health events, diagnoses, details, statuses, dates, and practitioners.
TREATMENT_TYPES stores editable treatment categories such as vaccines, antibiotics, or supplements.
TREATMENT_PRODUCTS stores editable products belonging to treatment categories.
ADMINISTRATION_ROUTES stores editable treatment administration methods such as oral or injectable.
TREATMENTS stores treatment details, including product, route, dosage, frequency, dates, and instructions.
HEALTH_SCHEDULES stores future health tasks such as follow-ups, next treatments, and quarantine clearances.
ALERT_ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS records which users acknowledged health schedule alerts.
REPRODUCTIVE_CYCLES stores female livestock reproductive cycles from opening through pregnancy, calving, or closure.
BREEDING_SERVICES stores breeding events, service dates, breeding methods, sires, and semen references.
BREEDING_SERVICE_PHOTOS stores image URLs and display order for breeding service photos.
PREGNANCIES stores pregnancy records linked to reproductive cycles and breeding services.
PREGNANCY_CHECKUPS stores pregnancy examination dates, results, gestation estimates, findings, and follow-up dates.
PREGNANCY_CHECKUP_ASSESSMENTS links pregnancy checkups to physical assessments.
PREGNANCY_CHECKUP_WEIGHTS links pregnancy checkups to livestock weight records.
CALVING_EVENTS stores calving dates, difficulty, assisting practitioners, and calving notes.
CALVING_OUTCOMES stores each calf outcome, including birth order, outcome, sex, weight, vigor, and livestock link.
CALF_CARE_PLANS stores planned calf-care tasks, due dates, statuses, and notes.
WEANING_RECORDS stores livestock weaning dates and notes.
WEANING_WEIGHTS links weaning records to the corresponding livestock weight records.
MANAGEMENT_DECISIONS stores farm decisions made for livestock, such as retaining, selling, culling, breeding, or transferring.
ACTIVITY_LOGS stores an audit trail of user actions and affected records.
SYSTEM_SETTINGS stores administrator-managed application configuration values.
